Statement: "Raising k from 5 to 10 is a reasonable first fix: more candidates make it more likely that the annual-plan chunk reaches the model."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'False. The chunk is already retrieved at rank 2, and recall@5 did not move with the release. More candidates give the packer more small chunks to prefer, which can push the 35-token annual-plan chunk out completely. Changing retrieval to fix a problem that happens after retrieval adds risk and fixes nothing - the evidence points at the next stage.', 2, 5
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM challenge.questions WHERE challenge_id = (SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_py_rag_331') AND order_index = 2)
    RETURNING id
)
