Statement: "The packer changed the order: the chunk ranked 2nd by retrieval became the last line, [4], and was cut at the budget."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'True. The log packs the chunks cheapest first (9, 11, 13 tokens), not in rank order, then cuts the next one to fill the remaining 17 tokens. The best chunk for the question ends up last and incomplete - a packing failure that recall@k cannot see, because recall is measured before packing.', 4, 5
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM challenge.questions WHERE challenge_id = (SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_py_rag_331') AND order_index = 4)
    RETURNING id
)
