Statement: "With the old packer and the same 50-token budget, the full annual-plan chunk would have reached the model."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'True. In rank order: kb-refunds#1 costs 13, kb-refunds-annual#1 costs 35, 13 + 35 = 48 <= 50, so both fit whole; the next chunks (11, 9, 41) are skipped because they do not fit. That confirms the hypothesis that the release''s packer is the root cause and gives the fix: restore rank order and skip instead of cut, then verify on the golden set with answer-level checks, not recall alone.', 6, 5
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM challenge.questions WHERE challenge_id = (SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_py_rag_331') AND order_index = 6)
    RETURNING id
)
